province = 65
blurb = "Depicts travelers on a road cut into the side of a mountain near the Tsumago post station, in present-day Nagano prefecture.

Today it is common for tourists to hike this section of the Kisokaidō (which later became the Nakasendō), as there's a well-maintained 8-kilometer hiking trail between Tsumago and the next station, Magome. I can personally attest that this area is even more spectacular in real life than in the prints."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
